g l_terrace "Setting: a rooftop terrace lounge in Dubai at golden hour, warm low sun, soft haze, a skyline of modern towers far in the background, two low armchairs angled toward each other, a small round table with two slim microphones on low stands and two glasses of water, a few green plants. $ST The upper third is the warm evening sky. On the left: the dark-haired woman from the reference photos, keep her identity and outfit exactly: thin gold-rimmed round glasses, emerald-green silk blouse, cream wide-leg trousers, nude heels; she sits gracefully with legs crossed and asks a question. On the right: $VIT, outfit exactly as in his full-length reference: sand-beige linen blazer, white polo shirt, off-white chinos; he answers with a calm open hand gesture." $H/host_E_face.jpg e3.jpg $V/office_solo.jpg v4.jpg &
g l_gallery "Setting: a premium property developer sales gallery, daylight through tall windows, a large illuminated architectural scale model of a waterfront district on a low plinth in front of them, pale stone floor, warm wood wall panels. $ST The upper third is a calm pale ceiling and wall. They stand on either side of the scale model. On the left: the blonde woman from the reference photos, keep her identity and outfit exactly: white tailored trouser suit with an ivory camisole, nude heels, long straight hair; she holds a slim black handheld microphone and listens. On the right: $VIT, outfit exactly as in his full-length reference: dark navy chalk-stripe three-piece suit, white shirt, dark navy tie; he points with an open hand at a part of the model while explaining." $H/host_G_face.jpg g2.jpg $V/office_solo.jpg v1.jpg &
g l_office "Setting: a glass-walled meeting room on a high floor in daylight, a wide panorama of a modern city and the sea behind the glass, a long dark wood table, two compact desktop microphones, a closed laptop and a notebook. $ST The upper third is bright sky behind the glass. They sit at the corner of the table. On the left: the dark-haired woman from the reference photos, keep her identity and outfit exactly: sleek low ponytail, black tailored trouser suit with a thin gold belt; she leans in slightly and asks a question. On the right: $VIT, with the same black thick-rimmed glasses and outfit exactly as in his full-length reference: black turtleneck under a charcoal blazer; he answers thoughtfully, one hand on the table." $H/host_E_face.jpg e2.jpg $V/office_solo.jpg v3.jpg vit_glasses_crop.jpg &
